  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 3,
  "question": {
    "text": "Let the area of the region <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to _____ .",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "125",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p>The area of the region <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>,</p><p>Now solving,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>And equating&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math>, we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now plotting the diagram of&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>,</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/cd08dde2-203a-4bff-bc6a-8b883674ddef-9896425.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 349px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Now from diagram, both curve are symmetric about <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence, area of the bounded region is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>125</mn></math>.</p>",
